SCOPE — please read this first

This repository contains code from several sources, and only this
project's own work is covered by the MIT license below.

  COVERED by the MIT license (original work in this project):
      every file in this repository EXCEPT the ones listed under NOT
      COVERED - the Python modules at the top level and in common/,
      evaluation/, exploration/, rewards/, training/, tools/ and tests/;
      static/ (except static/vendor/) and templates/; the documentation
      and configuration files; and
      mario_brain_checkpoint.zip  (the trained model weights)

  NOT COVERED — third-party, different terms, see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md:
      mario_clone/          (the Super Mario Bros clone and its assets)
